<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>つーるぺじ</title>
    <script src="/js/tailwindcss.js"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/page.css">
    <style>
        .page-header {
            padding: 60px 20px 32px;
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(88,101,242,0.15);
        }
        .page-header h1 {
            font-size: 2.4rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #fff;
            text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(88,101,242,0.4);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .search-wrap { display: flex; justify-content: center; }
        .tool-search {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 480px;
            padding: 12px 20px;
            background: rgba(30,30,30,0.85);
            border: 2px solid rgba(88,101,242,0.3);
            border-radius: 25px;
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-family: inherit;
            transition: border-color 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
        }
        .tool-search:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: #5865F2;
            box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(88,101,242,0.28);
        }
        .tool-search::placeholder { color: #72767d; }
        .tools-section { padding: 32px 20px 60px; }
        .tool-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr));
            gap: 18px;
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .tool-card {
            background: rgba(20,20,20,0.95);
            border: 1px solid rgba(88,101,242,0.2);
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 24px;
            transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
        }
        .tool-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(88,101,242,0.28);
            border-color: rgba(88,101,242,0.4);
        }
        .tool-card h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .tool-card p { color: #b9bbbe; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.5; }
        .tool-card a.tool-link {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 8px 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #5865F2 0%, #7289DA 100%);
            color: #fff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            box-shadow: 0 3px 12px rgba(88,101,242,0.3);
            transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .tool-card a.tool-link::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; left: -100%;
            width: 100%; height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.18), transparent);
            transition: left 0.5s;
        }
        .tool-card a.tool-link:hover::before { left: 100%; }
        .tool-card a.tool-link:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 6px 22px rgba(88,101,242,0.45); }
        .back-btn {
            position: fixed;
            top: 16px;
            left: 16px;
            z-index: 50;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            padding: 10px 18px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #5865F2 0%, #7289DA 100%);
            color: #fff;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(88,101,242,0.35);
            transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-family: inherit;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
        .back-btn:hover { transform: scale(1.06); box-shadow: 0 6px 22px rgba(88,101,242,0.5); color:#fff; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <a href="/gen" class="back-btn">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"></path>
        </svg>
        戻る
    </a>

    <div class="page-header">
        <h1>ツール</h1>
        <div class="search-wrap">
            <input type="text" id="search" placeholder="ツールを検索..." class="tool-search">
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="tools-section">
        <div class="tool-grid" id="tool-list">
            <div class="tool tool-card">
                <h3 class="tool-title">Android</h3>
                <p class="tool-description">くっそラグい仮想スマホで遊べます。</p>
                <a href="/tools/tool/android" class="tool-link">ツールを使用</a>
            </div>
            <div class="tool tool-card">
                <h3 class="tool-title">invAPIチェッカー</h3>
                <p class="tool-description">入力されたinvidiousのURLを動くものと動かないものに分けられます。</p>
                <a href="/tools/tool/inv" class="tool-link">ツールを使用</a>
            </div>
            <div class="tool tool-card">
                <h3 class="tool-title">htmlを取得</h3>
                <p class="tool-description">ウェブサイトのhtmlを取得して表示できます。</p>
                <a href="/tools/tool/htmlget" class="tool-link">ツールを使用</a>
            </div>
            <div class="tool tool-card">
                <h3 class="tool-title">htmlproxy</h3>
                <p class="tool-description">htmlを取得する簡単なProxy。</p>
                <a href="/tools/tool/get" class="tool-link">ツールを使用</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer style="background:rgba(10,10,10,0.98);border-top:1px solid rgba(88,101,242,0.2);color:#72767d;padding:20px;text-align:center;">(⁠+⁠_⁠+⁠)</footer>

    <script>
        const searchInput = document.getElementById('search');
        const tools = document.querySelectorAll('.tool');

        searchInput.addEventListener('input', function() {
            const q = this.value.toLowerCase();
            tools.forEach(tool => {
                const title = tool.querySelector('.tool-title').textContent.toLowerCase();
                const desc = tool.querySelector('.tool-description').textContent.toLowerCase();
                tool.style.display = (title.includes(q) || desc.includes(q)) ? '' : 'none';
            });
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
